
Hospital Patient Management System using Linked List

Develop a simple C++ Hospital Patient Management System using a singly linked list. The system should allow the user to:

Add a new patient with Patient ID and Name.

Display all patient records.

Search for a patient using Patient ID.

Exit the system.

The patient records are stored using nodes of a linked list, where each node contains the patient ID, patient name, and a pointer to the next patient.
